We'd sit around a table.
我们围坐在一张桌子旁。

00:07:14.884 --> 00:07:16.998
There was a great spread of food.
有很多食物。

00:07:16.998 --> 00:07:22.379
All the writers were where their producers, the department heads would come to that.
所有的编剧都在他们的制片人那里，部门主管也会来处理这一点。

