And by the way, just to say counterpoint, I was wildly nervous for all 200 native tables.
顺便说一句，我对所有 200 个本地表都感到非常紧张。

00:07:49.899 --> 00:07:50.899
You were.
你是。

00:07:50.899 --> 00:07:51.899
Okay.
好的。

00:07:51.899 --> 00:07:52.899
Well, miserably anxious.
嗯，焦急万分。

00:07:52.899 --> 00:07:53.899
I shocked that you weren't.
我很震惊你不是。

00:07:53.899 --> 00:07:55.259
But think about writer brand.
但想想作家品牌。

00:07:55.259 --> 00:07:56.899
Think about writer brand versus actor brand.
想想作家品牌与演员品牌。

00:07:56.899 --> 00:07:58.899
But they will read all about the script.
但他们会阅读有关剧本的所有内容。

00:07:58.899 --> 00:08:01.899
I mean, it's about performance, but we weren't.
